<title>USA: Compaq Computer Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Compaq Computer Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONSOLIDATED STATEMENT OF INCOME</p>
<p>						  1997		  1996</p>
<p> Sales				    $   4,805	  $   4,205</p>
<p> Cost of sales				3,627		3,320</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>  administrative expense		    499		  431</p>
<p> Research and development costs	   122		  103</p>
<p> Other income and expense, net	   (12)		   17</p>
<p>Income before provision</p>
<p>  for income taxes			    569		  334</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes		 182		  100</p>
<p> Net income				     387		  234</p>
<p>Earnings per common and</p>
<p>common equivalent share:</p>
<p>	 Primary				 1.36		 0.85</p>
<p>	 Assuming full dilution	    1.36		 0.85</p>
<p>Shares used in computing</p>
<p>earnings per common</p>
<p>and common equivalent share:</p>
<p>	 Primary				284.0		276.1</p>
<p>	 Assuming full dilution	   284.0		276.1</p>
<p>(in millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: The First Call consensus estimate for the first quarter was $1.31 per share.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
